# Keep line endings consistent across Windows and Linux checkouts.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary

# GitHub's language bar measures bytes of tracked files, so generated files can dominate it
# and misrepresent what the project is. These directives affect that statistic only — nothing
# is excluded from the repository, from builds, or from search.
#
# The SQL here is emitted by `prisma migrate`, not written by hand; the schema is the source
# of truth and lives in server/prisma/schema.prisma.
server/prisma/migrations/**/*.sql linguist-generated
package-lock.json                 linguist-generated
